@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@supplierOrderId = 1

### Branded purchase order PDF in the supplier's language
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pdf/supplierorder/{{supplierOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown supplier order PDF returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pdf/supplierorder/2147483647
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}